  "content": "<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fallthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cn0OGDE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"424\"><br><br></a></p><p><strong>ATM9</strong> 包含了超過&nbsp;<strong>400 個模組</strong>、無數的任務以及完善的終局內容。你能打造出 <strong>ATM 之星</strong>嗎？你敢挑戰 <strong>格雷之星</strong> 嗎？</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>All the Mods</strong>&nbsp;最初只是為了我幾個朋友而創建的私人整合包，沒想到後來變成其他玩家也想玩的內容！它擁有其他「知名」整合包的所有基本元素，但也混合了一些較新或較不知名的模組。&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>在&nbsp;<strong>All the Mods 9</strong>&nbsp;中，我們將延續傳統，在追求更穩定性的同時，加入許多新模組。</p><p><strong>「All the Mods」真的包含&nbsp;</strong><strong>所有</strong><strong>&nbsp;模組嗎？不，當然不可能。<br><br></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fallthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nrj9TOe.png\" width=\"748\" height=\"155\"><br><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oFsCP8O4J2w?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lEHQcqRwOUI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z9MgI39GMcc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AbOlMrNLM9U?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><br></a><br><br></p><p><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/J3J7CLX42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 請我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"301\" height=\"121\"></a></p>",
